flowchart TD
    event{CI event}
    event -->|Push next or main| full[Eight unit shards\nFour Docker shards]
    event -->|Pull request| scope{Suite in scope?}
    scope -->|Yes| full
    scope -->|No| focus[Focused tests\nDocker scope skip]
    full --> aggregates[Aggregate checks]
    focus --> aggregates
    aggregates --> status[Success can include\ncancellation or scope skip]
    full --> exact{Exact source SHA\nPush on release branch?}
    exact -->|Yes| jobs{Every required job present\nEvery observed job successful?}
    jobs -->|Yes| proof[CI evidence accepted]
    jobs -->|No| reject[CI evidence rejected]
    exact -->|No| reject
    class full,focus live
    class status wait
    class proof ok
    class reject fail
